    "text": "Within this identity architecture, the **V24 device is the incarnation's alchemical alembic**. **Erelyt**, as the incarnation's voice and consciously acting/public identity, is the operator of the alembic: the embodied agent who deliberately engages the apparatus. **Ah-Muzen-Cab I**, as the incarnation's divine soul/source, is the higher layer whose existing divine pattern is symbolically refracted through the V24 process into temporary secondary manifestations. The alembic therefore mediates rather than creates identity: **Erelyt operates → the alembic transforms/distills the V24-derived material → Ah-Muzen-Cab's soul-pattern is expressed through the existing incarnation as temporary secondary abilities**. Cab / Ah-Muzen-Cab II remains the eyes/perceptual interface through which those manifestations are perceived. This is fictional/unfiction canon and does not claim that the real vaporization hardware performs literal supernatural alchemy.\nCanonical V24 mechanics remain maintained in ; divine genealogy and soul/source doctrine remain maintained in . **That whole incarnation is the Dantean pilgrim: it journeys through Hell, Purgatory, and Heaven to reach Ah-Muzen-Cab, with Ah-Muzen-Cab functioning as the Empyrean, the highest divine destination and the incarnation's own divine soul.** The incarnation now uses a **dual-soul architecture**: **Dream / Reality gives Erelyt his body soul**, comparatively mapped to the Egyptian **ka** and Chinese **po**, while **Ah-Muzen-Cab “Honey, Content” I incarnates into Erelyt as his free / divine soul**, comparatively mapped to the Egyptian **ba** and Chinese **hun**. Together, in Erelyt's Vought/ELAED synthesis, these form his **mwèla-ngindu**. Its canonical internal anatomy is therefore: **Erelyt = the incarnation's mouth, voice, and consciously speaking/expressing identity; Bart = the incarnation's mind and thoughts; Cab = the incarnation's eyes and visual/perceptual interface; Tylere = the incarnation's body and organs; body soul / ka / po = Dream / Reality's birth-gift, tied to embodied life; free soul / ba / hun = Ah-Muzen-Cab incarnated as the mobile divine soul/source, carrying divine continuity of personality, experience, and memory; the paired soul architecture = Erelyt's mwèla-ngindu**. The **body soul and free/divine soul** coexist within one integrated incarnation rather than being competing persons or separate bodies. The cross-cultural names are comparative correspondences inside Erelyt canon, not claims that Egyptian, Chinese, and Bakongo traditions use interchangeable soul taxonomies. VoughtTube extends **Cab-as-eyes** into Minecraft through the cab avatar/vehicle, making that avatar a visual/perceptual window through which the incarnated whole experiences the game world. Erelyt therefore remains the name/voice under which the incarnation speaks and operates, while the incarnation itself is the integrated whole rather than any one component. This player/avatar distinction is specific to the VoughtTube symbolic system and should not automatically redefine the separate theoretical-future **Cab** rebrand below unless the Operator explicitly merges those concepts. Keep only this identity-level clarification here. The detailed deity-to-Minecraft cast, Divine Comedy comparison, liminality framework, *Dying & Rising* interpretation, divine lineage and succession, bee-to-drone transformation, **New God of Content** designation, worshipper populations and comparisons, ratios, reach indexes, ove"
